note aienux/crates/allen-reflex/reflex_test.om: behavioral tests for ALLEN REFLEX v0.
note Ports tests from tests/core.rs, tests/route.rs, and src/tower.rs.
note Returns 0 on pass and distinct non-zero exit codes on every failure.

note =========================================================================
note Training Corpus (representative cases covering all 15 actions & spans)
note =========================================================================

